  "description": "Once upon a time in the northern mountains, there lived beings with great powers. The most powerful were the Imae. Their chief decided to share their power with the weakest beings, the Foxes. They made a blood pact that was supposed to benefit both sides, but the Imae would always have the upperhand. The foxes decided to leave the mountains and have been hiding ever since. If I don’t use my powers in front of an Imae, I’ll be just fine, but now guess what happened…?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes 21 extra chapters.*",
